# Editing a field's text like any text box (decision 043): a caret that moves
# with the arrows, a selection, word jumps, and clicks that place the caret.

scenario: typing goes in at the caret, not always at the end
start timer
click
focus timer add
type buy milk                       -> draft=buy_milk caret=8
caret word-left                     -> caret=4
type oat                            -> draft=buy_oatmilk caret=7
caret start                         -> caret=0
caret right                         -> caret=1
caret end                           -> caret=11

scenario: Shift selects; typing or erasing replaces the selection
start timer
click
focus timer add
type hello world
caret word-left select              -> selected=world caret=6
type there                          -> draft=hello_there selected=none
caret start
caret right select
caret right select                  -> selected=he
erase                               -> draft=llo_there caret=0
caret end
caret left select
caret left                          -> selected=none caret=8  # an arrow without Shift lands on the selection's edge

scenario: Backspace and Delete, a character or (Ctrl) a word
start timer
click
focus timer add
type one two three
erase word                          -> draft=one_two_
erase word                          -> draft=one_
caret start
delete                              -> draft=ne_
delete word                         -> draft=empty
delete                              -> draft=empty          # nothing after the caret: no-op

scenario: a whole character at a time, never half of one
start timer
click
focus timer add
type café au lait
caret start
caret word-right
caret left                          -> caret=5              # é is two bytes: before the space, past é
caret left                          -> caret=3
delete                              -> draft=caf_au_lait
place 2 select                      -> selected=f
place 3                             -> selected=none caret=3

scenario: a click places the caret, Shift+click and drags select, double-click a word, Ctrl+A all
start timer
click
focus timer add at=0                -> draft=empty caret=0
type pick up the kids
place 5                             -> caret=5
place 11 select                     -> selected=up_the
select-word 13                      -> selected=kids
select-word 4                       -> selected=_          # the run of spaces
select-all                          -> selected=pick_up_the_kids
type done                           -> draft=done

scenario: editing a text in place starts with the caret where it was clicked
start timer
click
edit timer todo.edit.1 groceries at=3   -> draft=groceries caret=3
type -                              -> draft=gro-ceries
submit                              -> draft=none           # an edit ends once sent
focus timer add
type x
submit                              -> draft=empty caret=0  # the field empties and keeps focus

scenario: a field with a limit takes only as many characters as fit (decision 045)
start timer
click
focus timer add max=8
type café au lait                   -> draft=café_au_ caret=9   # 8 characters: é is one
type more                           -> draft=café_au_            # full: nothing goes in
caret start
caret right select
type x                              -> draft=xafé_au_            # replacing frees room
erase
type ab                             -> draft=aafé_au_            # only one fits
submit                              -> draft=empty
type 123456789                      -> draft=12345678            # the limit stays for the next one
